# Next.js Project Setup

## Package Dependencies
- Install Next.js 14+: `npm install next@latest react@latest react-dom@latest`
- Install Tailwind CSS: `npm install -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer`
- Install shadcn/ui: `npx shadcn@latest init`
- Install form handling: `npm install react-hook-form @hookform/resolvers zod`
- Install additional UI: `npm install lucide-react class-variance-authority clsx tailwind-merge`

## Configuration Files
- `next.config.js`: Configure for App Router and optimize bundle
- `tailwind.config.js`: Set up with shadcn/ui preset and custom colors
- `tsconfig.json`: Configure for Next.js and strict TypeScript
- `postcss.config.js`: Set up PostCSS for Tailwind processing

## Project Structure
- Create `src/app/` directory for App Router
- Set up `src/app/layout.tsx` as root layout
- Create `src/app/globals.css` for global Tailwind imports
- Organize components in `src/components/`
- Keep existing types in `src/types/`
- Maintain services in `src/services/`

## Environment Setup
- Copy `.env` variables from existing frontend
- Update API base URLs for Next.js environment
- Configure CORS and API routes if needed
- Set up proper environment variable handling
